<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>黔途拾趣 · 路线二 | 钓旅西行 · 毕节→威宁→六盘水→牂牁江→郎岱</title>
<meta name="description" content="全程贵阳以西，19℃避暑专线，钓鱼+露营+土著美食，零爬山">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;font-size:16px;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{font-family:"PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB","Microsoft YaHei","WenQuanYi Micro Hei",sans-serif;color:#1a2e1a;background:#f5f3ed;line-height:1.7;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
a{color:#2d6a4f;text-decoration:none;transition:color .3s}
a:hover{color:#c9a961}
.serif{font-family:"Noto Serif SC","Source Han Serif SC","STSong","SimSun",serif}

/* ========== Nav ========== */
.nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(245,243,237,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.nav-inner{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:.75rem 1.5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.nav-logo{font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a3a2a;letter-spacing:.04em}
.nav-logo span{color:#c9a961}
.nav-back{font-size:.8rem;color:#8a9a8a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem}
.nav-back svg{width:16px;height:16px}

/* ========== Hero (compact) ========== */
.hero{padding:5rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#0a1628 0%,#162a3a 25%,#1a5a5a 50%,#2d8a7f 70%,#52b788 88%,#95d5b2 100%)}
.hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:60px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent,#f5f3ed)}
.hero-badge{display:inline-block;padding:.3rem 1rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:2rem;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);margin-bottom:1.2rem}
.hero h1{font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:.6rem;line-height:1.3}
.hero h1 .gold{color:#e8c96a}
.hero p{font-size:.88rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);max-width:400px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;line-height:1.7}
.hero-tags{display:flex;gap:.5rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-tag{padding:.35rem .8rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:.4rem;font-size:.72rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}
.route-switch{display:flex;gap:.6rem;justify-content:center;margin-top:1.5rem}
.route-btn{padding:.45rem 1.2rem;border-radius:2rem;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s}
.route-btn.outline{background:transparent;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)}
.route-btn.fill{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);color:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3)}
.route-btn:hover{opacity:.85}

/* ========== Main container ========== */
.main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.2rem 3rem}

/* ========== Section headers ========== */
.sh{padding:2.5rem 0 1.2rem}
.sh-label{font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#aaa;margin-bottom:.3rem}
.sh-title{font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a3a2a}
.sh-desc{font-size:.82rem;color:#888;margin-top:.3rem}

/* ========== Day Card ========== */
.day-card{background:#fff;border-radius:1rem;margin-bottom:.8rem;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.04);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.04);transition:box-shadow .3s}
.day-card:hover{box-shadow:0 3px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.07)}
.day-summary{padding:1.1rem 1.2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
.day-dot{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:800;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0}
.day-dot.c3{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a6b7a,#2d9aab)}
.day-dot.c4{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2d6a4f,#52b788)}
.day-dot.c5{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6b4c1a,#c9a961)}
.day-dot.c6{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a4a6a,#8a7a9a)}
.day-meta{flex:1;min-width:0}
.day-date{font-size:.72rem;color:#aaa;font-weight:500}
.day-spots{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a3a2a;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.day-right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:.3rem;flex-shrink:0}
.day-temp{font-size:.68rem;padding:.2rem .6rem;border-radius:1rem;background:#eef2ff;color:#3a4a8a;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
.day-chev{width:20px;height:20px;color:#ccc;transition:transform .35s}
.day-card.open .day-chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}
.day-expand{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .45s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);position:relative;background-size:cover;background-position:center top;background-repeat:no-repeat}
.day-expand::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.55) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,.85) 30%,rgba(255,255,255,.95) 60%,rgba(255,255,255,.98) 100%);z-index:0;pointer-events:none;border-radius:0 0 1rem 1rem}

/* ========== Spot strip (inside expanded day) ========== */
.spot-strip{padding:0 1rem 1rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
.spot-chip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;padding:.8rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-radius:.75rem;margin-bottom:.5rem;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,box-shadow .2s;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.04);-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
.spot-chip:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}
.spot-chip:active{background:rgba(255,255,255,.96)}
.spot-emoji{font-size:1.3rem;flex-shrink:0}
.spot-chip-info{flex:1;min-width:0}
.spot-chip-name{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:#1a3a2a}
.spot-chip-sub{font-size:.72rem;color:#999;margin-top:.1rem}
.spot-chip-arrow{color:#ccc;font-size:.8rem;flex-shrink:0}

/* ========== Day info bar (expanded) ========== */
.day-info-bar{padding:0 1.2rem .8rem;display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative;z-index:1}
.info-pill{font-size:.68rem;padding:.25rem .7rem;border-radius:1rem;background:#f0f7f0;color:#2d6a4f;font-weight:500}
.info-pill.water{background:#e8f6f8;color:#1a6a7a}
.info-pill.food{background:#fef8ee;color:#8a6a2a}

/* ========== Modal ========== */
.modal-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:200;background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(4px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s}
.modal-overlay.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.modal-sheet{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:201;max-height:88vh;background:#fff;border-radius:1.2rem 1.2rem 0 0;box-shadow:0 -4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);transform:translateY(100%);transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(.32,.72,0,1);overflow-y:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
.modal-sheet.show{transform:translateY(0)}
.modal-handle{width:36px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#ddd;margin:10px auto 0}
.modal-header{padding:1rem 1.5rem .6rem;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;position:sticky;top:0;background:#fff;z-index:2}
.modal-title{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a3a2a}
.modal-subtitle{font-size:.78rem;color:#999;margin-top:.15rem}
.modal-close{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#f0f0f0;border:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1rem;color:#888;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .2s}
.modal-close:hover{background:#e0e0e0}
.modal-body{padding:0 1.5rem 2.5rem}
.modal-section{margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.modal-section h4{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;color:#aaa;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:.6rem}
.modal-text{font-size:.88rem;color:#3a4a3a;line-height:1.85}
.modal-text strong{color:#1a3a2a}
.modal-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin-bottom:.8rem}
.modal-tag{font-size:.68rem;padding:.2rem .6rem;border-radius:1rem;font-weight:500}
.modal-tag.nature{background:#e8f5e9;color:#2d6a4f}
.modal-tag.kid{background:#fff3e0;color:#e65100}
.modal-tag.easy{background:#e3f2fd;color:#1565c0}
.modal-tag.free{background:#f3e5f5;color:#6a1b9a}
.modal-tag.water{background:#e0f7fa;color:#00695c}
.modal-tag.temp{background:#eef2ff;color:#3a4a8a}

/* Tip box inside modal */
.mtip{padding:.7rem .9rem;border-radius:.6rem;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.7;margin-top:.8rem}
.mtip.green{background:#f0f7f0;border-left:3px solid #2d6a4f;color:#3a5a3a}
.mtip.blue{background:#f0fafa;border-left:3px solid #2d9aab;color:#1a5a6a}
.mtip.gold{background:#fdf8f0;border-left:3px solid #c9a961;color:#6b5a2a}

/* Food list in modal */
.food-list{list-style:none}
.food-list li{font-size:.85rem;color:#3a4a3a;padding:.3rem 0;padding-left:1rem;position:relative}
.food-list li::before{content:'·';position:absolute;left:.2rem;color:#c9a961;font-weight:700}
.food-price{font-size:.75rem;color:#c9a961;font-weight:600}

/* ========== Rule cards (compact) ========== */
.rule-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:.7rem;padding:.8rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.rule-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.rule-icon{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2d6a4f,#52b788);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:.7rem;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:.1rem}
.rule-text h4{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:#1a3a2a}
.rule-text p{font-size:.78rem;color:#888;line-height:1.6}

/* ========== Rejected (compact) ========== */
.reject-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;padding:.65rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.reject-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.reject-x{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(200,80,80,.08);color:#c85050;font-size:.7rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700}
.reject-name{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:#555}
.reject-reason{font-size:.72rem;color:#c85050}

/* ========== Water strip ========== */
.water-strip{display:flex;gap:.6rem;overflow-x:auto;padding:0 0 .8rem;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:none}
.water-strip::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.water-chip{min-width:200px;background:#fff;border-radius:.8rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid rgba(45,154,171,.1);flex-shrink:0}
.water-chip h4{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:#1a5a6a;margin-bottom:.2rem}
.water-chip .wc-loc{font-size:.68rem;color:#aaa;margin-bottom:.4rem}
.water-chip p{font-size:.78rem;color:#5a6a5a;line-height:1.6}

/* ========== Tips compact ========== */
.tips-accordion{background:#fff;border-radius:1rem;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.04);margin-bottom:.6rem}
.tips-head{padding:.9rem 1.1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:600;color:#1a3a2a}
.tips-head .t-icon{font-size:1rem}
.tips-head .t-chev{margin-left:auto;width:18px;height:18px;color:#ccc;transition:transform .3s}
.tips-accordion.open .t-chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}
.tips-body{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}
.tips-body-inner{padding:0 1.1rem 1rem}
.tips-body-inner ul{list-style:none}
.tips-body-inner li{font-size:.82rem;color:#5a6a5a;padding:.25rem 0;padding-left:1rem;position:relative}
.tips-body-inner li::before{content:'·';position:absolute;left:.2rem;color:#2d6a4f;font-weight:700}

/* ========== Footer ========== */
.footer{padding:2rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;color:#bbb;font-size:.78rem}
.footer a{color:#999}
.footer .heart{color:#c9a961}

/* ========== Modal Gallery ========== */
.modal-gallery{display:flex;gap:.5rem;overflow-x:auto;padding:.3rem 0 .6rem;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:none}
.modal-gallery::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.modal-gallery img{height:150px;min-width:150px;max-width:220px;border-radius:.6rem;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;background:#eee;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.modal-gallery img:hover{transform:scale(1.03);box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}
.modal-gallery img:active{transform:scale(.97)}

/* ========== Modal Video ========== */
.modal-video{position:relative;width:100%;padding-bottom:56.25%;border-radius:.6rem;overflow:hidden;margin:.5rem 0;background:#111}
.modal-video iframe{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:none}
.modal-video-label{font-size:.72rem;color:#999;margin-bottom:.3rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem}

/* ========== Lightbox ========== */
.lightbox{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:300;background:rgba(0,0,0,.92);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s;cursor:zoom-out}
.lightbox.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.lightbox img{max-width:92vw;max-height:88vh;border-radius:.5rem;object-fit:contain}
.lightbox-close{position:fixed;top:1rem;right:1rem;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border:none;color:#fff;font-size:1.2rem;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}

/* ========== Day Map Bar ========== */
.day-map-label{font-size:.72rem;color:#888;padding:.5rem 1.2rem .3rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem}
.day-map-row{display:flex;gap:.35rem;padding:0 1rem .7rem;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:none}
.day-map-row::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.map-loc{padding:.3rem .65rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-radius:1.2rem;font-size:.68rem;color:#2d6a4f;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid rgba(45,106,79,.1);text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s}
.map-loc:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.96)}
.map-loc.route-btn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2d6a4f,#40916c);color:#fff;font-weight:600;border-color:transparent}
.map-loc.route-btn:hover{opacity:.9}

/* ========== Modal Action Buttons ========== */
.modal-actions{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:1rem}
.m-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem;padding:.45rem .85rem;border-radius:2rem;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s;border:1px solid}
.m-btn.nav{background:#e8f5e9;color:#2d6a4f;border-color:rgba(45,106,79,.15)}
.m-btn.call{background:#e3f2fd;color:#1565c0;border-color:rgba(21,101,192,.15)}
.m-btn.book{background:#fff3e0;color:#e65100;border-color:rgba(230,81,0,.15)}
.m-btn.site{background:#f3e5f5;color:#6a1b9a;border-color:rgba(106,27,154,.15)}
.m-btn:hover{opacity:.85;transform:translateY(-1px)}

/* ========== Animations ========== */
.fade-in{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity .5s,transform .5s}
.fade-in.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}

/* ========== Responsive ========== */
@media(min-width:768px){
.hero h1{font-size:2.4rem}
.main{max-width:600px}
.modal-sheet{max-width:560px;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,100%);border-radius:1.2rem 1.2rem 0 0}
.modal-sheet.show{transform:translate(-50%,0)}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Nav -->
<nav class="nav"><div class="nav-inner">
<div class="nav-logo">黔途<span>拾趣</span> · 路线二</div>
<a href="index.html" class="nav-back"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>路线一</a>
</div></nav>

<!-- Hero (compact) -->
<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-badge">2026 · 贵阳以西 · D3—D6</div>
<h1 class="serif">钓旅<span class="gold">西行</span></h1>
<p>毕节出发一路向西，19℃凉都、高原野钓、星空露营、地道土著美食，全程零爬山</p>
<div class="hero-tags">
<div class="hero-tag">🌡️ 19℃</div>
<div class="hero-tag">🎣 每天野钓</div>
<div class="hero-tag">🏕️ 星空露营</div>
<div class="hero-tag">🍳 土著美食</div>
</div>

</section>

<div class="main">

<!-- ===== Rules (compact) ===== -->
<div class="sh"><div class="sh-label">RULES CHECK</div><div class="sh-title">六条规则 ✅</div></div>
<div class="day-card" style="padding:0 .4rem">
<div class="rule-row"><div class="rule-icon">✓</div><div class="rule-text"><h4>不爬山不暴走</h4><p>全部车到景，步行极少，大人小孩都轻松</p></div></div>
<div class="rule-row"><div class="rule-icon">✓</div><div class="rule-text"><h4>纯自然风光</h4><p>峡谷江景、高山草甸、古镇烟火、溪流营地</p></div></div>
<div class="rule-row"><div class="rule-icon">✓</div><div class="rule-text"><h4>避开人潮</h4><p>猫河、阿志河、郎岱古镇均为冷门秘境</p></div></div>
<div class="rule-row"><div class="rule-icon">✓</div><div class="rule-text"><h4>小孩每天可玩</h4><p>钓鱼、坐快艇、溪流踩水、露营观星</p></div></div>
<div class="rule-row"><div class="rule-icon">✓</div><div class="rule-text"><h4>100%全新路线</h4><p>与路线一完全不同方向</p></div></div>
<div class="rule-row"><div class="rule-icon">✓</div><div class="rule-text"><h4>避暑最高优先</h4><p>凉都19℃，全程无暴晒无爬坡，轻松遛娃</p></div></div>
</div>

<!-- ===== Day Cards ===== -->
<div class="sh"><div class="sh-label">DAILY PLAN</div><div class="sh-title">每日行程</div><div class="sh-desc">点击日期展开，再点击景点查看详情</div></div>

<!-- D3 -->
<div class="day-card" id="d3">
<div class="day-summary" onclick="toggleCard('d3')">
<div class="day-dot c3">D3</div>
<div class="day-meta">
<div class="day-date">8月10日</div>
<div class="day-spots">威宁小吃 → 水城古镇 → 六盘水</div>
</div>
<div class="day-right">
<div class="day-temp">≤27℃</div>
<svg class="day-chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
</div>
</div>
<div class="day-expand" style="background-image:url('https://s.coze.cn/image/MjZdiU5CMEs/')">
<div class="day-info-bar">
<span class="info-pill">🚗 毕节→威宁2h→六盘水2h</span>
<span class="info-pill food">🍳 威宁小吃</span>
<span class="info-pill">🏨 百车河温泉庄园</span>
</div>
<div class="spot-strip">
<div class="spot-chip" onclick="openModal('m-d3-weining')">
<div class="spot-emoji">🍠</div>
<div class="spot-chip-info">
<div class="spot-chip-name">威宁小吃</div>
<div class="spot-chip-sub">高原味道 · 小粑粑+烤洋芋</div>
</div>
<div class="spot-chip-arrow">›</div>
</div>
<div class="spot-chip" onclick="openModal('m-d3-guzhen')">
<div class="spot-emoji">🏘️</div>
<div class="spot-chip-info">
<div class="spot-chip-name">水城古镇 · 烙锅</div>
<div class="spot-chip-sub">280年青石板路 · 烙锅一条街</div>
</div>
<div class="spot-chip-arrow">›</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="day-map-label">📍 今日行程地图</div>
<div class="day-map-row">
